OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Facross the west with a touch of frost
OL,7,Fand some patches of fog developing.
OL,8,FOtherwise it will be a mainly cloudy
OL,9,Fevening and night with one or two
OL,10,Flight showers in the east.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FDry with some bright or sunny
OL,13,Fintervals in the west. Cloudier across
OL,14,Fthe east with the odd light shower.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,17,Fon Saturday with the chance of a few
OL,18,Flight showers in the east. Dry on
OL,19,FSunday and Monday with broken cloud
OL,20,Fand overnight frost and fog patches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
